# UI verification

No repo skill requires Playwright for local UI tweaks.

## Design Mode (in-IDE preview)

Signals: `browser_element` selection, a Design Mode / browser-preview screenshot, or the user already has the app open in the Cursor preview.

- Edit the code and stop. The preview is the verification surface.
- Do not open Playwright MCP, a second browser, or sign in again to re-check.
- Do not screenshot or `browser_evaluate` the live preview unless the user asks.

## Playwright is for

- Cloud agents
- Async / unattended runs
- An explicit request to use Playwright or a smoke spec
